# files total, not 11.
#
# Not fixed here, found in the same investigation and reported instead of
# guessed at, per this repository's own measurement rule:
#   - The prefill per-expert fallback this bug #2 fix added
#     (exec_prefill_onednn, moe_3gemm_swiglu_opt.cpp) reads routing weights
#     correctly regardless of max_topk -- verified against the gather kernel's
#     own source (moe_3gemm_swiglu_fuse.cl, `dst_rweight[k] =
